  "title": "Wanda T NDE 6944",
  "date": "1995",
  "content": "My 10 year old daughter was staying home with me due to my illness. She was watching TV while I rested on the sofa. I left my body and looked down at the room from the ceiling. I then passed through the ceiling into the attic and then through the roof. I remember seeing the nails pass me. Outside I saw our cows in the field around the house. I knew each one and where it was. My travel then got faster and I traveled a long way. I entered a very light room where there were other being of very bright light. It was bright but it did not hurt my eyes like it would here on Earth. They were distinct personalities. I felt comfortable. They showed me past events of my life and future events. I felt the emotions of others and myself. I understood our reasons for our actions and the emotions of all involved. I felt all mercy, love and understanding. I saw the effect of my death on my daughter and her future if I returned. One of the entities asked me if I was willing to return. I said 'Yes, but…' I never got to finish. I really did not want to leave this wonderful place. I felt myself traveling very quickly. I slammed back into my body with a big jolt. It took one second to feel the pain and atmospheric pressure return to my body, all surfaces upon which felt were weighed down by heavy chains. It was horrible to be back but I thought that someday I would understand why I was returned.",
